#NEXUS

[ turner2012a_fig69: Coelurosaur Bremer consensus, read by eye. Multi-way nodes: Daspletosaurus, Tarbosaurus, Tyrannosaurus and the Gorgosaurus pair; Dilong, Coelurus, Proceratosaurus and the rest; four compsognathids; Archaeornithomimus, Shenzhousaurus, Harpymimus and the rest; Albinykus, Shuvuuia and Mononykus; three therizinosaurs; Avimimus, Caudipteryx and the rest; four oviraptorids. No clade names are printed; the digits are Bremer values. 45 tips, 8 polytomies (4, 4, 4, 4, 3, 3, 3, 4 children). Sample 5 case (census 2, seed 20261215). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

